## Non-negotiable rules (all projects)

Full list: [`<root>/.github/copilot/boundaries.md`](/<root>/.github/copilot/boundaries.md)
(system scope) + each project's
`<project>/.github/copilot/instructions/general.md` (project scope).

Summary: one task at a time, preflight proof, "The Bottom Line" gate,
"continue" = next single task only. Never commit `.env` or secrets.
Include tests with every feature change. Never skip the Specify stage.
Log each discovered process improvement immediately in the project's
`docs/improvements-log.md` (do not defer).

## Spec workflow

All work follows the 4-status lifecycle:

```
specify → plan → in-progress → done → archived/
```

Each transition is a **hard human gate**. No status is skipped.
Full process: [`<root>/.github/copilot/spec-workflows/README.md`](/<root>/.github/copilot/spec-workflows/README.md).

| Type | Prefix | Use when |
|---|---|---|
| Change Request | `CR-` | New feature, pipeline step, schema change |
| Bug | `BUG-` | Defect fix, incorrect behavior |
| Improvement | `IMP-` | Non-functional enhancement, refactor, performance |

Type details + per-stage context:
[`<root>/.github/copilot/spec-workflows/spec-types.md`](/<root>/.github/copilot/spec-workflows/spec-types.md).

